      "text": "[9:20PM] #Maryland_Ikeja #TrafficUpdate \n\nGood vehicular movement from Anthony inward Maryland Intersection, en route to Odo'yalaro and Mobolaji Bank Anthony Way, with smooth traffic flow in both inward and outward directions.\nEfficient traffic conditions from LASUTH underneath bridge, inward and outward to Kodesoh Road, Oba Akinjobi Ikeja G.R.A., as well as Mobolaji Bank Anthony Way, with good movement in both directions.\nFree-flowing traffic on Oba Akran Link Bridge and Airport Link Bridge.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
