      "text": "[9:57PM] #Apongbon #TrafficUpdate \n\nGood vehicular movement from CMS Bridge inward Offin Canal Market stretch, extending to Ijora Olopa by NEPA Intersection.\nEfficient traffic flow on Broad Street stretch to Apongbon underneath the bridge, connecting Offin Canal Market, Olowogbowo, and Offin Canal Market.\nSmooth movement on Eko Bridge by NEPA Intersection inward Apongbon, and descending Eko Bridge inward CMS, Elegbeta Mini Stadium, Ebute-Ero Market.\nGood traffic conditions from Ebute-Ero Market inward Leventist, through UBA Roundabout, connecting Inner and Outer Marina.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
